<h5 class="privacy-heading-content">1. Who We Are</h5>
<p>
    Our website address is: <a href="https://minnieworld.com" target="_blank">https://minnieworld.com</a>.
</p>

<h5 class="privacy-heading-content">2. Information We Collect</h5>
<ul>
    <li>
                <span class="privacy-listheading">Comments:</span> When visitors leave comments, we collect the data provided in the comments form, as well as the visitor’s IP address and browser user agent string to help detect spam.
    </li>
    <li>
                <span class="privacy-listheading">Cookies:</span> Cookies may store your name, email address, and website for your convenience when leaving a comment or logging in.
    </li>
    <li>
                <span class="privacy-listheading">Media:</span> If you upload images to the site, avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) to prevent unintended sharing of sensitive data.
    </li>
</ul>

<h5 class="privacy-heading-content">3. Use of Your Information</h5>
<p>We use the information collected for the following purposes:</p>
<ul>
    <li><span class="privacy-listheading">Improvement:</span> To analyze and enhance our content, services, and functionality.</li>
    <li><span class="privacy-listheading">Monetization:</span> To serve personalized advertisements through third-party ad networks such as Google AdSense.</li>
     <li><span class="privacy-listheading">Communication:</span> To respond to inquiries or provide updates if you contact us.</li>
</ul>

<h5 class="privacy-heading-content">4. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h5>
<p>
    We use cookies to improve your browsing experience. These cookies may:
</p>
<ul>
    <li>Remember your login details for convenience.</li>
    <li>Serve personalized ads and content.</li>
</ul>
<p>
    You can manage cookie preferences through your browser settings. However, disabling cookies may impact your experience with our site.
</p>

<h5 class="privacy-heading-content">5. Embedded Content from Other Websites</h5>
<p>
